    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the local emergency housing rent control act, in relation to\nthe date in calendar year 2022 when the local legislative body of a city\nhaving a population of one million or more may determine the continuation of\nthe emergency; and providing for the repeal of such provisions upon the\nexpiration thereof",
